{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 11,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 458.297,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that Zeniff conferred the kingdom upon Noah, one of his sons;",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.963,
      "end": 7.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore Noah began to reign in his stead;",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.837,
      "end": 10.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did not walk in the ways of his father.",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.628,
      "end": 14.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, he did not keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.919,
      "end": 18.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he did walk after the desires of his own heart.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.721,
      "end": 21.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he had many wives and concubines.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.641,
      "end": 24.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did cause his people to commit sin,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.654,
      "end": 28.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do that which was abominable in the sight of the Lord.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.271,
      "end": 32.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they did commit whoredoms and all manner of wickedness.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 33.316,
      "end": 36.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he laid a tax of one fifth part of all they possessed,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 36.7,
      "end": 39.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a fifth part of their gold and of their silver,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 40.131,
      "end": 45.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a fifth part of their ziff, and of their copper, and of their brass and their iron;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.512,
      "end": 47.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a fifth part of their fatlings;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 47.921,
      "end": 50.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also a fifth part of all their grain.",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 51.016,
      "end": 55.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all this did he take to support himself, and his wives and his concubines;",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.933,
      "end": 59.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also his priests, and their wives and their concubines;",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 59.782,
      "end": 62.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus he had changed the affairs of the kingdom.",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.156,
      "end": 68.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he put down all the priests that had been consecrated by his father,",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 68.259,
      "end": 70.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and consecrated new ones in their stead,",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.179,
      "end": 74.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as were lifted up in the pride of their hearts.",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 74.924,
      "end": 78.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and thus they were supported in their laziness,",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 78.355,
      "end": 81.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in their idolatry, and in their whoredoms,",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.646,
      "end": 85.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by the taxes which king Noah had put upon his people;",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 85.216,
      "end": 88.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus did the people labor exceedingly to support iniquity.",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 89.518,
      "end": 97.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they also became idolatrous, because they were deceived by the vain and flattering words of the king and priests;",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 97.453,
      "end": 100.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they did speak flattering things unto them.",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 101.477,
      "end": 106.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Noah built many elegant and spacious buildings;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 107.044,
      "end": 111.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he ornamented them with fine work of wood, and of all manner of precious things,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 112.147,
      "end": 117.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of gold, and of silver, and of iron, and of brass, and of ziff, and of copper;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 118.26,
      "end": 120.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also built him a spacious palace,",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 120.948,
      "end": 123.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a throne in the midst thereof,",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 123.357,
      "end": 125.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all of which was of fine wood",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 125.998,
      "end": 129.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was ornamented with gold and silver and with precious things.",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 130.533,
      "end": 135.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also caused that his workmen should work all manner of fine work",
      "verse": "11:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 135.589,
      "end": 139.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "within the walls of the temple, of fine wood, and of copper, and of brass.",
      "verse": "11:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 140.541,
      "end": 143.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the seats which were set apart for the high priests,",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 143.972,
      "end": 146.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were above all the other seats,",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 146.567,
      "end": 148.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he did ornament with pure gold;",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 149.162,
      "end": 152.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he caused a breastwork to be built before them,",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 152.453,
      "end": 156.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might rest their bodies and their arms upon",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 156.534,
      "end": 160.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while they should speak lying and vain words to his people.",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 160.697,
      "end": 163.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he built a tower near the temple;",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 164.174,
      "end": 165.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a very high tower,",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 166.072,
      "end": 169.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so high that he could stand upon the top thereof",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 169.689,
      "end": 171.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and overlook the land of Shilom,",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 172.005,
      "end": 174.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the land of Shemlon,",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 174.414,
      "end": 176.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was possessed by the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 177.009,
      "end": 180.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he could even look over all the land round about.",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 181.218,
      "end": 186.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he caused many buildings to be built in the land Shilom;",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 186.46,
      "end": 191.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he caused a great tower to be built on the hill north of the land Shilom,",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 191.423,
      "end": 196.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been a resort for the children of Nephi at the time they fled out of the land;",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 196.619,
      "end": 198.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus he did do with the riches",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 198.982,
      "end": 202.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he obtained by the taxation of his people.",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 202.773,
      "end": 206.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he placed his heart upon his riches,",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 206.482,
      "end": 210.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he spent his time in riotous living with his wives and his concubines;",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 211.167,
      "end": 214.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and so did also his priests spend their time with harlots.",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 215.516,
      "end": 220.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he planted vineyards round about in the land;",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 220.619,
      "end": 224.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he built wine-presses, and made wine in abundance;",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 224.236,
      "end": 226.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore he became a wine-bibber,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 226.877,
      "end": 228.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also his people.",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 228.904,
      "end": 235.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites began to come in upon his people, upon small numbers,",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 235.4,
      "end": 237.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to slay them in their fields,",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 237.67,
      "end": 240.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and while they were tending their flocks.",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 240.765,
      "end": 244.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Noah sent guards round about the land to keep them off;",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 244.707,
      "end": 247.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he did not send a sufficient number,",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 247.488,
      "end": 250.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites came upon them and killed them,",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 251.105,
      "end": 254.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and drove many of their flocks out of the land;",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 254.35,
      "end": 256.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus the Lamanites began to destroy them,",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 257.131,
      "end": 259.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to exercise their hatred upon them.",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 260.179,
      "end": 264.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Noah sent his armies against them,",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 264.864,
      "end": 268.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were driven back, or they drove them back for a time;",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 268.713,
      "end": 271.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, they returned rejoicing in their spoil.",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 272.365,
      "end": 274.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, because of this great victory",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 275.053,
      "end": 277.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were lifted up in the pride of their hearts;",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 277.927,
      "end": 280.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did boast in their own strength,",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 280.429,
      "end": 285.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saying that their fifty could stand against thousands of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 285.671,
      "end": 287.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they did boast,",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 287.569,
      "end": 289.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did delight in blood,",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 289.514,
      "end": 292.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the shedding of the blood of their brethren,",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 292.991,
      "end": 296.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of the wickedness of their king and priests.",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 297.293,
      "end": 303.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was a man among them whose name was Abinadi;",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 303.696,
      "end": 305.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he went forth among them,",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 305.78,
      "end": 307.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to prophesy, saying:",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 308.096,
      "end": 310.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, thus saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 310.18,
      "end": 312.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus hath he commanded me, saying,",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 312.868,
      "end": 315.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go forth, and say unto this people,",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 315.184,
      "end": 316.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus saith the Lord\u2014",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 317.082,
      "end": 318.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo be unto this people,",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 318.887,
      "end": 323.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have seen their abominations and their wickedness, and their whoredoms;",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 323.757,
      "end": 327.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and except they repent I will visit them in mine anger.",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 327.781,
      "end": 330.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And except they repent and turn to the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 331.072,
      "end": 334.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I will deliver them into the hands of their enemies;",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 334.921,
      "end": 337.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they shall be brought into bondage;",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 337.702,
      "end": 341.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be afflicted by the hand of their enemies.",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 342.097,
      "end": 349.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that they shall know that I am the Lord their God, and am a jealous God,",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 349.289,
      "end": 351.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "visiting the iniquities of my people.",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 352.43,
      "end": 354.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 354.468,
      "end": 357.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except this people repent and turn unto the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 358.085,
      "end": 360.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be brought into bondage;",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 360.541,
      "end": 362.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none shall deliver them,",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 362.439,
      "end": 364.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be the Lord the Almighty God.",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 365.534,
      "end": 369.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and it shall come to pass that when they shall cry unto me",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 369.429,
      "end": 371.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will be slow to hear their cries;",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 371.838,
      "end": 375.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I will suffer them that they be smitten by their enemies.",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 376.512,
      "end": 379.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And except they repent in sackcloth and ashes,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 379.618,
      "end": 382.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cry mightily to the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 382.538,
      "end": 384.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will not hear their prayers,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 384.483,
      "end": 387.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither will I deliver them out of their afflictions;",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 387.821,
      "end": 390.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus saith the Lord, and thus hath he commanded me.",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 391.659,
      "end": 396.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that when Abinadi had spoken these words unto them",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 397.133,
      "end": 398.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were wroth with him,",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 399.171,
      "end": 401.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sought to take away his life;",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 401.673,
      "end": 404.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the Lord delivered him out of their hands.",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 405.418,
      "end": 408.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when king Noah had heard of the words",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 408.292,
      "end": 411.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which Abinadi had spoken unto the people,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 411.351,
      "end": 413.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was also wroth; and he said:",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 413.853,
      "end": 415.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who is Abinadi,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 415.519,
      "end": 418.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I and my people should be judged of him,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 418.95,
      "end": 420.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or who is the Lord,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 420.755,
      "end": 424.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that shall bring upon my people such great affliction?",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 425.057,
      "end": 427.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I command you to bring Abinadi hither,",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 427.745,
      "end": 429.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may slay him,",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 429.365,
      "end": 431.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he has said these things",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 431.356,
      "end": 435.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might stir up my people to anger one with another,",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 435.948,
      "end": 438.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to raise contentions among my people;",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 438.589,
      "end": 440.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I will slay him.",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 440.941,
      "end": 443.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the eyes of the people were blinded;",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 443.304,
      "end": 447.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they hardened their hearts against the words of Abinadi,",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 447.71,
      "end": 450.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they sought from that time forward to take him.",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 450.584,
      "end": 454.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Noah hardened his heart against the word of the Lord,",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 454.758,
      "end": 457.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did not repent of his evil doings.",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 135
    }
  ]
}